  "body_html": "<h1>Survives.mono</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem Survives.mono {G : StrategicGame N U} {m n : ℕ} (hmn : m ≤ n) {i : N} {s : G.strategy i} (h : G.Survives n i s) : G.Survives m i s</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategy</li>\n<li>IsNashEquilibrium.survives</li>\n<li>Survives</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.refl</li>\n<li>Indifferent.refl</li>\n<li>IVariant.refl</li>\n<li>Arena.Reachable.step</li>\n<li>CPState.step</li>\n<li>Survives.prev</li>\n</ul>",
